{"availability":"available","full":"neknaj/NEPL3","name":"NEPL3","description":"Experimental language infrastructure for Grammar, Doc, Math and Circuit DSLs, with portable contracts and a Rust no_std architecture. Design and development tooling stage.","category":"Design","language":"Rust","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-06T10:29:45Z","updated":"2026-10-17T04:40:08Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://neknaj.github.io/NEPL3/","topics":["digital-circuits","dsl","grammar","language-design","mathml","no-std","parser","rust","webassembly"],"demo":"https://neknaj.github.io/NEPL3/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T05:14:24.884Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T05:14:24.884Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T05:14:24.884Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T06:14:25.477Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T05:14:24.884Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["NEPL3は、多数の異なるDSLを、括弧なし前置記法の共通規律で多階層・再帰的に相互埋め込みする言語基盤を開発するプロジェクトです。reader/tokenizer、構文、source位置、診断、editor支援の契約を共有し、言語を切り替えたときの視覚的・構文的な断絶を小さくします。各言語の意味論は各言語が所有します。","各headの子の数と読取り規則は、その位置までに確定したcontextとtoken自身から決めます。先行する宣言やimportによって後続・内側のcontextを更新でき、後続情報で既読の構文shapeは変更しません。構文が確定した後の名前解決・型付け・評価等は、各言語固有の規則で行えます。","これは基盤の設計原則です。現行の宣言body・登録済みcontextの契約はGrammar仕様、新schemaやreaderを後続へ導入する一般経路の提案は後述の統合設計草案を参照してください。"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/neknaj/NEPL3/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f549487691e54f3593ecff815a3f1f93e47931f7ed49159635b174bfbcb914db","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:25.636Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:25.636Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"NEPL3は、多数の異なるDSLを、括弧なし前置記法の共通規律で多階層・再帰的に相互埋め込みする言語基盤を開発するプロジェクトです。reader/tokenizer、構文、source位置、診断、editor支援の契約を共有し、言語を切り替えたときの視覚的・構文的な断絶を小さくします。各言語の意味論は各言語が所有します。","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/neknaj/NEPL3/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"f549487691e54f3593ecff815a3f1f93e479